===Withdrawn===
====Democratic Movement====
*[[Nino Burjanadze]], [[Georgia (country)|Georgia]]n politician and lawyer who served as Chairman of [[Parliament of Georgia]] (2001-2008). She has served as the acting [[President of Georgia]] twice.<ref>{{Cite web|url=http://georgiatoday.ge/news/11763/Presidential-Candidate-Zurabishvili-Claims-Georgia-Started-August-2008-War|title=Presidential Candidate Zurabishvili Claims Georgia Started August 2008 War|website=Georgia Today on the Web|access-date=2 October 2018|archive-date=2 October 2018|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20181002043304/http://georgiatoday.ge/news/11763/Presidential-Candidate-Zurabishvili-Claims-Georgia-Started-August-2008-War|url-status=dead}}</ref> She backed out of the election on 8 September.<ref>{{cite web|url=http://www.ipn.ge/en/politicss/97818-nino-burjanadze-boycotts-presidential-election.html?rund=1536518542|title=Nino Burjanadze boycotts presidential election|date=8 September 2018|publisher=Interpressnews|accessdate=9 September 2018|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20180909221850/http://www.ipn.ge/en/politicss/97818-nino-burjanadze-boycotts-presidential-election.html?rund=1536518542|archive-date=9 September 2018|url-status=dead}}</ref>

===Declined===
==== Independent ====
